---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site.config';
---
<Base title="About" description="Why CallChrist exists: scripture and prayer for people in hard moments.">
  <article class="wrap prose" style="padding-top:3rem">
    <h1>About CallChrist</h1>
    <p class="opening">A quiet place to turn when life gets hard.</p>
    <p>
      When you're anxious at 2 a.m., sitting in a hospital waiting room, or reading an email you didn't want to get,
      it can be hard to know what to pray. CallChrist gives you scripture for that exact moment and a prayer you can
      pray right away, in your own words or in ours.
    </p>
    <p>
      We're not a church and we don't belong to a denomination. Our hope is simply to point you to Jesus, who invites
      everyone who is weary and burdened to come to Him.
    </p>
    <p>
      Prayer is not a replacement for help from people. If you're facing a medical, legal, or mental health emergency,
      please contact a professional, your pastor, or someone you trust, and keep praying too.
    </p>
    <p>Scripture quotations are from the {SITE.translationName}.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
